# The user's global gitignore excludes every `.claude/` directory. craft ships sample
# context/override bodies under examples/.claude/workflow/ so the example manifests lint
# as-is (the linter resolves a manifest's relative refs against examples/; ADR-063).
# Re-include exactly that path so the committed samples reach a clone and CI's
# examples-lint gate is reproducible — without this the samples would be silently dropped.
!examples/.claude/
!examples/.claude/workflow/
!examples/.claude/workflow/*.md
!adapters/pi/.claude/
!adapters/pi/.claude/workflow.md
# P22 memory store + metrics — committable even where .claude/ is globally ignored
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/craft-memory.md
!.claude/craft-metrics.md
!.claude/workflow.md

# Stryker mutation-testing artifacts (regenerated per run, never committed)
/reports/
/engine/.stryker-tmp/

# G1: advisory miner outputs — generated in-repo, never committed
/report.json
/report.md
